	(text "MAT_ALLOWED requires external MATRIX_PERMIT, released fault\nclear and no latched fault. Power loss or clear resets\nframe arm. Capture registers have no defined startup state;\ntheir outputs cannot energize the matrix before a fresh\nqualified commit."
